      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "THE LADDER",
      "narration_text": "First, every show is stored many times over, at different qualities: a ladder from a few hundred kilobits a second to several megabits. I made two test clips, a clean test card and a grainy, detailed zoom, and encoded each one at six rungs.",
