    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "VMAF",
      "narration_text": "To judge the quality, Netflix built a score called VMAF, from zero to a hundred, and gave it away in twenty sixteen. On my test card, the lowest rung scored thirty-eight, and the top rung ninety-six. The grainy clip topped out at seventy-five.",
