    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "PER TITLE",
      "narration_text": "So one ladder doesn't fit every show. My test card reached a score of ninety-three at about four megabits. The grainy clip never got there, even at five point eight. Since twenty fifteen, Netflix has built a ladder for each title.",
