    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "THE PLAYER",
      "narration_text": "Then the show is cut into chunks a few seconds long, and before each one the player picks a rung. I streamed ten minutes over a connection that sags and drops. Always picking the best quality stalled for seven seconds. Picking by how full the buffer was never stalled, and streamed at a higher quality than picking by speed.",
