    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "CLOSE BY",
      "narration_text": "Distance matters too. Netflix's network, Open Connect, puts its own servers inside internet providers, filled with popular shows overnight. In my model, a chunk from a far server took one and a half seconds. From one inside your provider, half a second.",
