      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "SCALE",
      "narration_text": "By twenty twenty-two, that network had about eighteen thousand servers in a hundred and seventy-five countries. Today it serves more than three hundred and twenty-five million memberships. And newer codecs like A-V-1, now about thirty percent of viewing, fit the same picture into fewer bits.",
